Today is Wednesday evening.
I finish my work at the office.
The time is exactly six fifteen now.
Every Wednesday at six o'clock I go to the gym.
But today I am not going to the gym.
I walk to the bicycle repair shop.
This shop is near my flat.
The mechanic is in the shop.
He looks at me and smiles.
"Your bicycle is ready," he says.
He gives me the bicycle.
I check the wheel.
It is fine now.
I always like riding a bicycle.
Sometimes I ride the bicycle in the evening.
I start riding the bicycle to the flat.
The weather in Kochi is very nice in February.
Every day I go through this beautiful road.
I reach the flat happily.
